{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>You saw that from the heavens I spoke with you.</b> And not from the earth; even so, you did not see the likeness of My glory — and thus it says: ״כי לא ראיתם כל תמונה ביום דבר ה׳״ etc. And since this is so, you must not make with Me gods of silver and gods of gold — any image in the world, to say: this is the likeness of the appearance of the glory."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:59:05.406184489Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}